WEBVTT

00:03.150 --> 00:07.520
Hey, Master. I didn't think I'd get 
to see you again in this life.

00:07.800 --> 00:11.980
I didn't think you were still alive, Girart.

00:13.980 --> 00:15.030
Well, yeah.

00:15.470 --> 00:18.690
I don't know why I'm still kicking either.

00:20.040 --> 00:24.420
We've got a lot to talk about, 
but let's start with introductions.

00:24.420 --> 00:27.660
Meet the current king of beasts, Wolfgang.

00:28.460 --> 00:30.420
And his daughter, Cuore.

00:30.770 --> 00:32.670
These two are my confidants.

00:32.970 --> 00:35.370
My right hand, Van Ku,

00:35.680 --> 00:38.930
and my left hand, Rajim Dolk.

00:39.200 --> 00:43.810
I'm Shin. Maybe you've already heard, 
but I'm a high human.

00:44.420 --> 00:45.790
It's nice to meet you.

00:47.130 --> 00:49.940
You can talk like you normally do, Master.

00:50.300 --> 00:52.640
Then talk to <i>me</i> like you normally do!

00:52.640 --> 00:55.200
You've never called me "Master" before.

00:55.480 --> 01:00.200
We haven't seen each other in so long.
Let me have my fun.

01:00.610 --> 01:05.210
Besides, it's the only way 
to put them at ease.

01:05.210 --> 01:06.210
What?

01:06.210 --> 01:12.210
You know how crazy high humans are.

01:13.260 --> 01:15.610
To the people of this world,

01:15.610 --> 01:21.210
high humans are legendary beings 
to be feared and revered.

02:55.020 --> 02:57.280
Hey, are you still alive?

02:57.620 --> 02:58.780
Couldn't be better.

02:59.090 --> 03:00.670
How many did you kill?

03:00.670 --> 03:04.030
A hundred? A thousand? Maybe more.

03:05.300 --> 03:07.040
The moment of truth is still to come.

03:08.240 --> 03:09.410
I'm raring to go.

03:09.970 --> 03:11.170
Good.

03:11.170 --> 03:13.470
Watch my back.

03:18.650 --> 03:21.210
I thought we were dead men back then.

03:21.210 --> 03:24.300
Right? I'm amazed we both came out all right.

03:24.580 --> 03:27.160
How many did we end up slaying?

03:27.160 --> 03:28.840
I don't remember.

03:28.840 --> 03:29.810
Right?

03:29.810 --> 03:33.900
Speaking of things that have happened 
in the last five hundred years...

03:34.370 --> 03:37.800
Schnee told me all about 
how you founded a nation.

03:37.800 --> 03:39.940
Hey! You went and spilled the beans?

03:40.300 --> 03:43.100
I was going to brag about it.

03:43.100 --> 03:47.200
Knowing you, I figured you would exaggerate,

03:47.690 --> 03:51.000
so I provided an objective account 
of my observations.

03:51.000 --> 03:52.210
What?!

03:53.780 --> 03:55.210
I believe it.

03:56.370 --> 03:59.490
I'll go make some tea.

03:59.490 --> 04:00.710
Sure. Thanks.

04:01.670 --> 04:05.970
I guess the tales of my heroism 
will have to wait.

04:05.970 --> 04:08.930
Tell me about you instead.

04:10.340 --> 04:15.190
Well, I've told Schnee, but the truth is...

04:16.620 --> 04:22.030
I see. No wonder I couldn't find you 
no matter how much I looked.

04:22.740 --> 04:26.850
Sounds like you've gotten yourself 
into some strange trouble.

04:26.850 --> 04:32.120
You're telling me. 
The silver lining is that it's not all bad.

04:34.300 --> 04:37.310
Yeah... You're right.

04:38.250 --> 04:40.880
At the very least, 
this is a great thing for me.

04:42.420 --> 04:43.450
Girart?

04:44.540 --> 04:46.640
Let's get down to business.

04:47.020 --> 04:51.670
Shin, there's something I have to tell you.

04:51.670 --> 04:52.550
What is it?

04:55.210 --> 04:57.650
I'm going to die soon.

04:58.610 --> 04:59.400
What?

04:59.400 --> 05:00.930
I don't have long to live.

05:01.490 --> 05:04.540
I probably have less than a month left.

05:04.540 --> 05:06.410
How do you know?

05:06.900 --> 05:10.150
I've felt something was off 
for a few weeks now,

05:10.870 --> 05:13.910
but when Schnee told me about you, 
I was certain.

05:14.420 --> 05:18.670
It seems time has begun flowing for me again,

05:18.670 --> 05:22.170
as though it were waiting for your return.

05:23.550 --> 05:29.550
If there are gods in this world, 
perhaps they heard my prayers.

05:29.550 --> 05:30.730
Your prayers?

05:36.380 --> 05:38.560
Duel me, Shin.

05:41.740 --> 05:44.070
I want to fight you.

05:50.730 --> 05:57.780
<i>Girart, do you intend 
to die in battle, as a warrior?</i>

05:59.470 --> 06:04.100
<i>I can't help but wish for it, Shin.</i>

06:05.450 --> 06:09.970
<i>I want to duel you, the strongest warrior.</i>

06:10.670 --> 06:18.410
<i>How effective are my fangs 
against someone so superhuman?</i>

06:22.310 --> 06:25.210
Very well. I accept.

06:28.110 --> 06:30.550
Have you told Wolfgang and the others?

06:31.300 --> 06:33.370
About my life expectancy, yes.

06:33.660 --> 06:37.220
I haven't told them about the duel yet,
 but I won't hide it.

06:37.220 --> 06:39.250
I intend to tell them.

06:40.090 --> 06:44.800
That said, I think Van and Rajim 
have realized what I want.

06:44.800 --> 06:46.040
Your brothers-in-arms?

06:46.040 --> 06:46.880
Yeah.

06:47.730 --> 06:51.640
Since you disappeared, we've fought together.

06:52.010 --> 06:56.510
They're two of the longest-lived 
types of beasts.

06:56.890 --> 06:59.970
They've followed me this whole time.

07:00.390 --> 07:03.260
But we're all getting old.

07:03.260 --> 07:07.670
It's time this nation
 was freed of our influence.

07:08.150 --> 07:11.530
I heard Wolfgang is an exceptional ruler.

07:11.530 --> 07:12.160
He is.

07:12.580 --> 07:16.610
He listens to the people and can walk 
shoulder-to-shoulder with them.

07:17.030 --> 07:20.160
He's already a fine replacement for me.

07:20.490 --> 07:22.270
Any regrets?

07:23.380 --> 07:26.420
Only that I haven't dueled you.

07:30.630 --> 07:31.810
I see.

07:35.870 --> 07:38.930
There's something I must tell you.

07:39.740 --> 07:41.690
I've found the place where I'll die.

07:42.040 --> 07:42.720
What?

07:43.650 --> 07:46.060
What do you mean by that?

07:46.530 --> 07:49.190
I've told you how long I have left.

07:49.950 --> 07:54.070
I've asked Shin to duel me
 before my time's up.

07:54.980 --> 07:57.330
The duel will take place one week from now.

07:58.830 --> 08:00.700
I see.

08:00.700 --> 08:04.830
So the time has finally come.

08:05.120 --> 08:10.310
Yeah. My unfulfilled wish 
is finally coming true.

08:11.030 --> 08:12.250
Very well.

08:14.670 --> 08:18.640
How... How are you all so calm?

08:19.040 --> 08:20.410
You're going to...

08:20.940 --> 08:22.600
I've lived a long life.

08:24.670 --> 08:29.210
I've watched companions fall, their sons die,

08:30.150 --> 08:33.430
and even cared for their grandchildren 
on their deathbeds.

08:35.450 --> 08:38.990
Why have I lived all this time?

08:40.250 --> 08:43.370
In one week, you'll learn the reason.

08:44.100 --> 08:46.690
I want you to see it happen.

08:51.050 --> 08:51.940
Very well.

08:54.530 --> 08:56.390
We'll fight in the Raluah Forest.

08:56.980 --> 09:01.010
It will be the final 
and greatest battle of my life.

09:01.620 --> 09:03.520
I want all of you to witness it.

09:04.230 --> 09:05.140
Yes, Your Majesty!

09:12.780 --> 09:14.530
A duel, huh?

09:15.860 --> 09:19.030
Just when I finally got to see you again...

09:19.030 --> 09:19.580
Shin?

09:23.010 --> 09:24.540
Is something wrong?

09:24.840 --> 09:26.670
No, it's nothing.

09:28.050 --> 09:29.040
I'm okay.

09:35.390 --> 09:40.490
<i>Shin, I admired you.</i>

09:41.330 --> 09:45.260
<i>When you disappeared,
I was filled with regret.</i>

09:46.120 --> 09:49.670
<i>A single, tremendous regret.</i>

09:53.830 --> 09:58.070
The world was bland without you.

09:59.010 --> 10:03.330
<i>I'd given up on my wish, 
thinking it would never come true.</i>

10:04.590 --> 10:06.780
<i>Thank you, Shin.</i>

10:48.740 --> 10:51.240
I've restored them to perfect condition.

10:51.240 --> 10:53.420
Now you can fight your heart out.

10:53.420 --> 10:54.680
Hey!

10:54.680 --> 10:56.760
Feels like the clock's turned back!

10:57.620 --> 10:59.260
Thank you, Shin.

10:59.950 --> 11:01.010
Don't worry about it.

11:01.950 --> 11:03.850
Tomorrow's finally the day.

11:04.390 --> 11:05.270
Yeah.

11:06.490 --> 11:10.450
Shin, I know I should 
mind my own business, but...

11:11.380 --> 11:12.300
What is it?

11:15.610 --> 11:18.450
Is this about Schnee?

11:19.890 --> 11:20.750
Yeah.

11:21.630 --> 11:28.170
If you find a way to go home, 
will you return to your world?

11:29.460 --> 11:31.410
<i>Will you leave Schnee behind?</i>

11:39.700 --> 11:40.660
I'm going home.

11:43.020 --> 11:47.690
That's the reason I've kept fighting.

11:51.350 --> 11:52.350
I see.

11:53.490 --> 11:54.310
Sorry.

11:54.870 --> 11:57.770
No, I should be the one apologizing.

11:58.260 --> 12:00.070
I shouldn't have asked.

12:02.540 --> 12:04.570
It's a difficult thing.

12:07.030 --> 12:14.630
If only there were a way to solve 
everything at once, for me and for Schnee.

12:15.100 --> 12:18.690
You used to call yourself something
whenever you were in trouble...

12:18.690 --> 12:20.840
An opportunist, was it?

12:20.840 --> 12:25.470
Yeah. I wanted everything to go my way

12:25.470 --> 12:29.600
and reach a happy end 
where we lived happily ever after.

12:31.070 --> 12:35.690
That's not something 
we'll ever get to experience.

12:35.690 --> 12:36.570
Seriously.

12:39.590 --> 12:42.610
I'm looking forward to tomorrow.

12:44.980 --> 12:45.750
Yeah.

12:51.380 --> 12:53.580
It's the perfect day for a duel.

12:53.580 --> 12:56.170
Right? How are you feeling?

12:56.170 --> 12:57.580
I'm ready anytime.

12:57.580 --> 13:01.140
My body and mind are raring to go!

13:03.650 --> 13:06.390
We will wait here.

13:06.390 --> 13:09.100
If any stray attacks go flying, 
I'll need you to stop them.

13:09.460 --> 13:13.490
I will. Don't worry about anything, 
and fight to your heart's content.

13:13.490 --> 13:14.450
Got it.

13:17.020 --> 13:19.780
I will leave Girart in your hands.

13:19.780 --> 13:20.570
Yeah.

13:20.570 --> 13:21.690
Um...

13:22.390 --> 13:23.690
We'll see you later.

13:23.690 --> 13:24.860
Good luck, Shin!

13:26.180 --> 13:27.360
I'll be back.

13:28.450 --> 13:30.060
The rest is up to you.

13:30.060 --> 13:31.300
Good luck.

13:32.660 --> 13:35.870
I'll never forget your teachings 
as the first king.

13:36.320 --> 13:38.580
You can trust me 
with the kingdom and its people.

13:38.580 --> 13:39.330
Yeah.

13:42.620 --> 13:43.870
I...

13:47.020 --> 13:48.090
I'll also...

13:50.680 --> 13:53.890
I'll also become a warrior worthy 
of the first king's bloodline.

13:54.490 --> 13:55.290
Good.

13:58.280 --> 13:59.290
Shall we go?

13:59.290 --> 14:00.050
Yeah.

14:01.400 --> 14:05.100
I haven't seen the king smile
 like that in a long time.

14:05.100 --> 14:07.400
He's grinning like a child.

14:11.460 --> 14:17.020
Let us witness the first king 
realize his wish together.

14:19.280 --> 14:20.010
Right.

14:25.130 --> 14:26.300
Ready?

14:26.650 --> 14:27.740
Anytime.

14:38.220 --> 14:39.210
It's begun.

14:40.100 --> 14:41.690
Shin!

14:41.690 --> 14:43.820
Girart!

14:47.900 --> 14:49.570
Your blows are as heavy as ever!

14:50.510 --> 14:53.580
Don't act like you can't shrug them off!

15:01.020 --> 15:03.840
Doesn't this remind you 
of five hundred years ago?

15:04.220 --> 15:07.090
It feels like just yesterday for me!

15:08.900 --> 15:10.580
Of course!

15:12.180 --> 15:13.720
Same for me!

15:19.460 --> 15:20.610
Incredible.

15:20.610 --> 15:23.730
I had no idea the first king was this strong.

15:26.330 --> 15:28.690
They should be done warming up soon.

15:28.690 --> 15:31.540
His warm-ups are always quite the spectacle.

15:31.540 --> 15:34.180
That's our king.

15:34.670 --> 15:37.240
You mean <i>that's</i> still not their full power?

15:37.240 --> 15:38.500
Of course not.

15:38.890 --> 15:41.870
Master, you're as strong as them, right?

15:42.450 --> 15:46.340
Even I would struggle against Girart.

15:46.340 --> 15:49.630
<i>But that still means she's stronger...</i>

15:49.940 --> 15:53.510
This is a battle between 
a high human and Girart.

15:53.930 --> 15:56.030
We must sear this into our eyes.

15:59.370 --> 16:04.060
Even the techniques I developed 
to fight you are useless.

16:04.060 --> 16:06.150
I'd expect no less from my master.

16:06.420 --> 16:09.900
Don't play dumb. 
I know you're stronger than this.

16:10.210 --> 16:13.150
Yeah. I'm going to put everything
 on the line now.

16:13.630 --> 16:16.500
Hear me. Watch as I become...

16:17.140 --> 16:19.410
a single fang!

16:30.060 --> 16:30.800
<i>Shin.</i>

16:31.790 --> 16:33.980
<i>I know how you feel.</i>

16:35.800 --> 16:37.930
I'll fight as hard as I can tomorrow.

16:38.450 --> 16:42.180
But I won't use the titles I acquired 
from defeating the final boss.

16:42.580 --> 16:44.940
Relying on such unfair abilities
wouldn't be cool.

16:45.820 --> 16:49.820
<i>If I were in Shin's position, 
I would've done the same.</i>

16:50.170 --> 16:55.450
<i>But even if this is over
in the blink of an eye,</i>

16:56.380 --> 16:58.740
<i>I want to fight Shin at full power.</i>

17:00.580 --> 17:07.420
This is the only moment
my fangs can reach you!

17:08.170 --> 17:09.590
Here I come!

17:15.180 --> 17:16.340
Too slow!

17:19.780 --> 17:22.810
You didn't think you could 
beat me with this, did you?!

17:22.810 --> 17:23.850
Of course not!

17:27.710 --> 17:28.520
He's coming.

17:31.500 --> 17:33.240
My ultimate technique...

17:33.240 --> 17:36.020
Legendary Excellence!

17:44.130 --> 17:46.000
That's a pretty tough one!

17:48.000 --> 17:49.460
Eight Flower Palm!

17:50.820 --> 17:53.510
Twin Flying Springs!

17:53.510 --> 17:55.800
<i>He's chaining different skills together.</i>

17:55.800 --> 18:00.510
<i>He must've trained incredibly hard 
to develop this strategy.</i>

18:03.260 --> 18:07.900
<i>Pathetic. He's risking his life, while I...</i>

18:09.330 --> 18:11.150
<i>I'm sorry, Girart.</i>

18:11.830 --> 18:14.780
<i>I haven't been fighting at full strength.</i>

18:20.160 --> 18:22.410
That's the spirit!

18:23.660 --> 18:24.750
Legendary...

18:25.680 --> 18:28.160
Excellence!

18:28.160 --> 18:30.250
Heavenly Haze!

18:33.990 --> 18:35.670
It will be over soon.

18:46.810 --> 18:48.810
Gotcha!

18:59.930 --> 19:01.010
Girart?

19:05.940 --> 19:07.060
Girart!

19:07.060 --> 19:08.580
I hear you.

19:10.500 --> 19:13.750
Looks like this is the end.

19:14.770 --> 19:18.350
You got me at the end. I'm impressed, Girart.

19:19.870 --> 19:22.590
I haven't lived five hundred
 years for nothing.

19:23.020 --> 19:26.600
This fang landed a blow on you.

19:27.570 --> 19:29.940
My long-awaited wish has been fulfilled.

19:30.390 --> 19:35.770
Shin, as a reward for landing a blow on you, 
will you do something for me?

19:35.770 --> 19:36.480
What is it?

19:37.270 --> 19:41.200
I'm glad I got to fight you at full strength.

19:41.200 --> 19:44.410
But there's more, isn't there?

20:07.890 --> 20:10.640
I had no idea you were so powerful.

20:14.110 --> 20:15.290
Farewell.

20:16.110 --> 20:17.310
Girart...

20:18.420 --> 20:19.490
See you later.

20:27.370 --> 20:32.170
Yeah... That's my master, all right.

20:37.750 --> 20:39.260
It's over.

20:45.910 --> 20:47.180
Girart!

20:47.180 --> 20:48.730
Girart!

20:52.090 --> 20:54.150
Raise your heads.

20:55.460 --> 21:01.070
Your king scored a hit on me, a high human.

21:01.730 --> 21:06.070
That means Girart ascended to our level.

21:07.820 --> 21:09.090
Girart...

21:09.410 --> 21:12.820
Behold the king's face.

21:14.300 --> 21:17.780
He looks satisfied.

21:18.080 --> 21:20.920
Not a single regret.

21:20.920 --> 21:22.220
You're right.

21:22.220 --> 21:25.970
Yeah. He'd laugh at us if he saw us crying.

22:11.980 --> 22:13.010
Schnee?

22:13.810 --> 22:17.770
You look like you're about 
to disappear somewhere.

22:18.540 --> 22:19.770
I'll do anything.

22:20.510 --> 22:23.940
If there's anything I can 
do for you, please tell me.

22:25.100 --> 22:26.590
I know.

22:28.190 --> 22:31.510
I know this is what Girart wanted.

22:32.050 --> 22:32.780
Yes.

22:33.630 --> 22:35.980
I accepted that and fought him.

22:36.510 --> 22:37.290
Yes.

22:38.060 --> 22:39.220
But...

22:39.810 --> 22:40.420
Yes.

22:42.230 --> 22:44.670
It hurts to have a friend die.

22:46.690 --> 22:49.430
You fulfilled your duty, Shin.

22:50.690 --> 22:51.680
You can cry now.

22:52.740 --> 22:54.930
It's okay to be sad now.

23:35.050 --> 23:40.060
<b>Next Time
Episode 9
<b>The Queen of Bayrelicht</b></b>
